1
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:11,991
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">FROM ME TO YOU</font>

2
00:01:08,839 --> 00:01:12,051
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Anyhow, she really is an admirable girl.</font>

3
00:01:12,134 --> 00:01:14,929
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The type that makes
you want to root for her.</font>

4
00:01:15,012 --> 00:01:18,182
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Really? She must be a
real beauty then too, eh?</font>

5
00:01:18,265 --> 00:01:22,311
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'd say so. In fact she
looks just like that over there.</font>

6
00:01:22,394 --> 00:01:25,606
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, c'mon that's givin' me
some major heebie jeebies.</font>

7
00:01:25,689 --> 00:01:28,943
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- It's her looks.
- Just her looks, huh?</font>

8
00:01:29,026 --> 00:01:30,152
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako.</font>

9
00:01:30,236 --> 00:01:31,195
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Heh? Sadako?</font>

10
00:01:32,113 --> 00:01:38,285
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Her name! It's her name! It's pronounced
Sawako and written as "cheerful child."</font>

11
00:01:43,707 --> 00:01:45,751
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">For some reason,
everyone is always afraid of me.</font>

12
00:01:45,835 --> 00:01:47,878
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I hear she has a strong sixth
sense, so she draws spirits over to her.</font>

13
00:01:47,962 --> 00:01:50,005
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Even her name's
Sadako, like from The Ring.</font>

14
00:01:50,089 --> 00:01:53,384
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But all I want is to get along with them.</font>

15
00:01:53,467 --> 00:01:56,804
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Her parents must've had foresight to give
her such a perfect name. Know what I mean?</font>

16
00:02:00,516 --> 00:02:01,976
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm done. Go ahead.</font>

17
00:02:07,857 --> 00:02:09,400
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey there, Kuronuma.</font>

18
00:02:10,151 --> 00:02:12,319
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Kazehaya, you do your homework?
- Kazehaya is the complete opposite of me.</font>

19
00:02:12,403 --> 00:02:14,822
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No, I haven't.</font>

20
00:02:14,905 --> 00:02:17,324
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Right? We're in the same boat.
- It's like everyone gathers around</font>

21
00:02:17,408 --> 00:02:21,120
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya and everything just flows from
there.</font>

22
00:02:21,787 --> 00:02:25,416
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The day of the high
school entrance ceremony...</font>

23
00:02:27,710 --> 00:02:28,627
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">U- Um...</font>

24
00:02:31,797 --> 00:02:37,052
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If you happen to be looking for
Kitahoro High, it's that way.</font>

25
00:02:37,636 --> 00:02:42,308
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thanks alot!</font>

26
00:02:43,809 --> 00:02:47,271
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">People usually apologize to me when I
talk to them, but he smiled and told me,</font>

27
00:02:47,354 --> 00:02:51,192
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"Thank you."</font>

28
00:02:51,275 --> 00:02:54,069
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And one day, I'd sincerely hope
I can become a person like him.</font>

29
00:02:54,153 --> 00:02:56,947
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She's got this!</font>

30
00:02:57,031 --> 00:03:03,954
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Yes~ good! Keep going!
- The most popular one in class, eh?</font>

31
00:03:04,038 --> 00:03:10,085
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well Kazehaya at least. Sawako on
the other hand is a complete outcast.</font>

32
00:03:10,169 --> 00:03:11,629
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh... Sadako?</font>

33
00:03:12,379 --> 00:03:15,299
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You know Yuka who sat in Sadako's seat?
She was out sick with a cold for a whole</font>

34
00:03:15,382 --> 00:03:18,344
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">week.</font>

35
00:03:18,427 --> 00:03:19,345
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You got this.</font>

36
00:03:22,181 --> 00:03:23,557
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Um... Excuse me...
- Hm?</font>

37
00:03:23,641 --> 00:03:25,309
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hm?</font>

38
00:03:25,392 --> 00:03:28,520
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't worry, it isn't dirty.</font>

39
00:03:28,604 --> 00:03:31,815
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A- And nothing bad
will happen in that seat.</font>

40
00:03:33,067 --> 00:03:35,986
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't have any powers like that.</font>

41
00:03:37,529 --> 00:03:38,572
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I said it!</font>

42
00:03:40,282 --> 00:03:41,825
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I really said it.</font>

43
00:03:44,203 --> 00:03:46,455
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}A seating change, huh?</font>

44
00:03:46,538 --> 00:03:50,751
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I hope this time I can get along better
with the people sitting next to me. -Wow,</font>

45
00:03:50,834 --> 00:03:55,089
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">just like that
Kazehaya's surrounded. -N-No!</font>

46
00:03:56,340 --> 00:04:00,844
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's a little lonely not being able to
share joy over sitting by your friend, or</font>

47
00:04:00,928 --> 00:04:05,432
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">disappointment over
being seated far away.</font>

48
00:04:06,725 --> 00:04:08,769
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Whoever's 19, trade me.</font>

49
00:04:08,852 --> 00:04:10,062
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

50
00:04:10,145 --> 00:04:11,063
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh... what?</font>

51
00:04:11,689 --> 00:04:12,606
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya?</font>

52
00:04:18,362 --> 00:04:20,322
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Alright, next to Kuronuma.</font>

53
00:04:26,537 --> 00:04:28,580
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I don't want this.
- What?</font>

54
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,588
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yoshida, you're next.</font>

55
00:04:36,672 --> 00:04:40,509
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Nope, I'm good right
here. Get outta here Ryu!</font>

56
00:04:40,592 --> 00:04:41,635
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No thanks.</font>

57
00:04:41,719 --> 00:04:43,762
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Tsk!</font>

58
00:04:45,264 --> 00:04:47,433
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My seat... makes me so happy...</font>

59
00:04:53,689 --> 00:04:55,149
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I... don't have words...</font>

60
00:05:01,780 --> 00:05:02,906
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm happy.</font>

61
00:05:04,450 --> 00:05:09,955
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ever since that day, I've had all
these feelings I never knew of before.</font>

62
00:05:10,039 --> 00:05:11,999
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My heart's overflowing.</font>

63
00:05:12,916 --> 00:05:15,252
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I want to treasure them.</font>

64
00:05:15,336 --> 00:05:19,465
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Like I've been given a
gift for the very first time.</font>

65
00:05:21,175 --> 00:05:23,260
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Honestly--
- Hm?</font>

66
00:05:23,344 --> 00:05:26,680
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh? How goes it, boys?</font>

67
00:05:27,389 --> 00:05:30,976
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- And how come you're always like this?
- I just wanted to attend your little</font>

68
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:34,563
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">lecture here on how great Sawako is!</font>

69
00:05:34,646 --> 00:05:38,192
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako was... just starting to
find her place among her peers.</font>

70
00:05:38,275 --> 00:05:42,279
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah, but that was
unfortunately short-lived.</font>

71
00:05:42,363 --> 00:05:44,573
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm asking you where
this bull crap started!</font>

72
00:05:44,656 --> 00:05:46,909
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sa... Sadako.</font>

73
00:05:47,618 --> 00:05:48,535
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Huh?
- Huh?</font>

74
00:05:49,244 --> 00:05:50,662
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's what I heard.</font>

75
00:05:50,746 --> 00:05:55,000
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako's trying to make herself popular
and she's using you, Yano and especially</font>

76
00:05:55,084 --> 00:05:59,338
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Kazehaya in order to do it.
- But I'm happy for you.</font>

77
00:05:59,421 --> 00:06:02,966
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You were able to make friends. I
believe their names are Yano and Yoshida?</font>

78
00:06:03,050 --> 00:06:06,637
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Huh?
- Th- They're not my friends!</font>

79
00:06:10,474 --> 00:06:14,228
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Those dark rumors about Yano and
Yoshida are pretty extreme huh?</font>

80
00:06:14,311 --> 00:06:18,107
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Dark rumors? About being my backup?</font>

81
00:06:21,652 --> 00:06:25,739
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's why they looked so upset
earlier. They must've been hurting.</font>

82
00:06:25,823 --> 00:06:29,952
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- It's all Sadako's fault.
- Uh-huh. Because she's always</font>

83
00:06:30,035 --> 00:06:34,331
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- hanging around and latching on to them.
- Poor Kazehaya too.</font>

84
00:06:34,415 --> 00:06:38,085
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If Sadako continues to hang around him
like this, she'll definitely ruin his</font>

85
00:06:38,168 --> 00:06:41,880
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- reputation.
- This is... my fault?</font>

86
00:06:44,508 --> 00:06:49,972
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">As long as I'm around, I'm sure
I'll only end up hurting them again.</font>

87
00:06:50,055 --> 00:06:52,349
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And they don't deserve that.</font>

88
00:06:53,183 --> 00:06:58,021
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Things may straighten out eventually... But
Yano and Yoshida are hurting right now,</font>

89
00:06:58,105 --> 00:07:02,943
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">and I have no idea how I'm supposed
to comfort either of them until then.</font>

90
00:07:03,026 --> 00:07:09,032
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's why, I think it's better to go
back to the way I was and distance myself.</font>

91
00:07:09,116 --> 00:07:11,910
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's for the best I'm sure of it.</font>

92
00:07:15,205 --> 00:07:20,836
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}She may not look it, but Sawako's
got quite the positive mindset.</font>

93
00:07:20,919 --> 00:07:22,880
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Misunderstandings. Rumors.</font>

94
00:07:23,922 --> 00:07:26,383
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ugh, this is beyond frustrating!</font>

95
00:07:26,467 --> 00:07:31,513
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thaaat's right! But now who do
you think is even more frustrated?</font>

96
00:07:31,597 --> 00:07:35,392
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If you don't hate me, then why avoid me?</font>

97
00:07:39,396 --> 00:07:42,691
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"Don't... talk to me, ever again"</font>

98
00:07:44,985 --> 00:07:49,865
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait! I'm sorry, I take it back!</font>

99
00:07:50,407 --> 00:07:56,163
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I see. So the rumors made it
awkward between you, Yano and Yoshida.</font>

100
00:07:57,456 --> 00:08:02,085
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What if things were the other way around?
- Huh? Like if the rumor was that by</font>

101
00:08:02,169 --> 00:08:06,798
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">hanging out with you Yano, Yoshida and I
would ruin your reputation...</font>

102
00:08:06,882 --> 00:08:09,343
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So we'd distance ourselves from you.</font>

103
00:08:10,719 --> 00:08:11,720
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'd hate that.</font>

104
00:08:13,514 --> 00:08:15,349
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'd want to stay together.</font>

105
00:08:18,018 --> 00:08:21,313
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Then Yano and Yoshida
would say the same thing.</font>

106
00:08:22,606 --> 00:08:26,944
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It just depends on how
the other person feels.</font>

107
00:08:27,027 --> 00:08:31,406
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">His kind words... and that smile...
they always push me to keep going.</font>

108
00:08:33,075 --> 00:08:36,411
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hnag in there Kuronuma, you've got this.</font>

109
00:08:36,495 --> 00:08:37,538
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Good luck.</font>

110
00:08:39,623 --> 00:08:40,832
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Cool! And handsome to boot!
- Heh?</font>

111
00:08:40,916 --> 00:08:42,167
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Heh?</font>

112
00:08:43,293 --> 00:08:47,339
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, you! Don't butt into
our conversation like that!</font>

113
00:08:47,422 --> 00:08:51,843
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My apologies, I can't
help it! Romance is my thing.</font>

114
00:08:51,927 --> 00:08:55,722
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">He's too young for this...
such a disappointment!</font>

115
00:08:55,806 --> 00:08:58,892
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Squeaky, squeaky, squeaky clean!</font>

116
00:08:58,976 --> 00:09:04,022
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So Kazehaya was watching over
Sawako then... The entire time, huh?</font>

117
00:09:04,565 --> 00:09:09,194
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah, that's right, and it gave her the
courage she needed. Now, it's her turn to</font>

118
00:09:09,278 --> 00:09:13,949
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- stand up for herself and fight.
- You're wrong!</font>

119
00:09:17,703 --> 00:09:20,372
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You don't have to leave me alone!</font>

120
00:09:20,455 --> 00:09:23,834
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Just take back what you said.
- What are you talking a--</font>

121
00:09:23,917 --> 00:09:27,337
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">All of it... Everything that you're saying
is wrong! You don't get it and how could</font>

122
00:09:27,421 --> 00:09:30,507
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you?</font>

123
00:09:31,216 --> 00:09:35,137
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I guess it's cause you
don't know anything about them.</font>

124
00:09:37,055 --> 00:09:41,059
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They've always treated me kindly even
though they never had a reason to. You all</font>

125
00:09:41,143 --> 00:09:45,147
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">have no idea how much I like both Yano
and Yoshida... more than I can put into</font>

126
00:09:45,230 --> 00:09:49,610
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">words</font>

127
00:09:49,693 --> 00:09:50,611
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...Much more.</font>

128
00:09:52,487 --> 00:09:53,405
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's why...</font>

129
00:10:03,248 --> 00:10:06,501
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Y- Yoshida! -She spread those rumors
about you, and you're still gonna help</font>

130
00:10:06,585 --> 00:10:09,880
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">her?! -It wasn't Sadako.</font>

131
00:10:10,672 --> 00:10:13,133
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- She'd never do something like that.
- She'd never do something like that.</font>

132
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:16,845
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If we say it wasn't her, then it wasn't
and that's that. Get out of here, before I</font>

133
00:10:16,928 --> 00:10:19,973
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">have to force you out!</font>

134
00:10:22,059 --> 00:10:26,313
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So I, would like to ask if
maybe you two would be my...</font>

135
00:10:28,815 --> 00:10:31,818
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I would like it if we
could become friends!</font>

136
00:10:37,824 --> 00:10:38,950
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're so silly.</font>

137
00:10:42,287 --> 00:10:46,291
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Didn't you know? It's hard for us to do
anything but think the whole world of you.</font>

138
00:10:46,375 --> 00:10:50,379
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And besides...</font>

139
00:10:50,462 --> 00:10:56,009
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're worried about friends but you
don't realize you already have them.</font>

140
00:10:56,093 --> 00:10:59,680
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako! You, me and Yano? We ARE friends.</font>

141
00:11:00,389 --> 00:11:01,223
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We are?</font>

142
00:11:03,725 --> 00:11:06,019
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We already... are friends?</font>

143
00:11:08,146 --> 00:11:11,358
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wow... my very first... real friends.</font>

144
00:11:16,196 --> 00:11:19,741
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Do you think she's gonna be okay?
Yuka's had a serious crush on Kazehaya</font>

145
00:11:19,825 --> 00:11:23,370
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">since middle school.</font>

146
00:11:27,958 --> 00:11:29,000
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey!</font>

147
00:11:29,084 --> 00:11:29,960
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Wait!
- Yuka!</font>

148
00:11:34,339 --> 00:11:37,676
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Such stupid girls. I don't know what they
expected... When you make a big scene like</font>

149
00:11:37,759 --> 00:11:41,096
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">that, of course
Kazehaya's gonna hate you.</font>

150
00:11:45,726 --> 00:11:48,437
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hey Kurumi!
- Oh.</font>

151
00:11:53,358 --> 00:11:57,487
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've been hearing a lot of rumors
involving Sadako everwhere lately.</font>

152
00:11:57,571 --> 00:12:01,324
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Oh yeah, didn't we see her
hanging out with Kazehaya before?</font>

153
00:12:01,408 --> 00:12:05,203
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Oh yea, I remember that. We were both
saying stuff like, "Oh my gosh, are the</font>

154
00:12:05,287 --> 00:12:07,622
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}- two of them dating now?"
- There's no way that would ever happen!</font>

155
00:12:07,706 --> 00:12:10,041
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}You think so?</font>

156
00:12:11,209 --> 00:12:16,173
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If Kazehaya did actually like
her would it be that weird?</font>

157
00:12:20,135 --> 00:12:23,680
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh? I ddin't know you were
on the Field Day Committee?</font>

158
00:12:23,764 --> 00:12:27,517
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh. You're here to Kurumi That's great.</font>

159
00:12:27,601 --> 00:12:31,396
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You know the album released before the
one I lent you? The cover of that fourth</font>

160
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:34,941
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">song... Kazehaya? Are you listening,</font>

161
00:12:35,025 --> 00:12:38,487
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Oh. My bad, what were you talking about?
- The CD that was released</font>

162
00:12:38,570 --> 00:12:41,406
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">before the one I lent you.</font>

163
00:12:41,490 --> 00:12:44,367
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, got it I'll be sure
to bring it next time.</font>

164
00:13:20,821 --> 00:13:23,198
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So this time she's the problem, eh...</font>

165
00:13:23,824 --> 00:13:28,370
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She was glaring right at Sawako,
I have a bad feeling about it.</font>

166
00:13:30,705 --> 00:13:31,623
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako!</font>

167
00:13:37,838 --> 00:13:38,755
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako, hi!</font>

168
00:13:41,341 --> 00:13:44,636
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And so, if the ball gets passed
here, Sawako, you need to make your move...</font>

169
00:13:44,719 --> 00:13:48,014
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako!</font>

170
00:13:48,098 --> 00:13:49,099
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hm?
- Hm?</font>

171
00:13:50,433 --> 00:13:51,351
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako!</font>

172
00:13:52,310 --> 00:13:53,228
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">See ya!</font>

173
00:13:54,813 --> 00:13:55,730
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Bye-bye.</font>

174
00:13:56,731 --> 00:14:01,403
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Another one I can't believe
I made another new friend.</font>

175
00:14:01,486 --> 00:14:07,158
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">To be honest, I didn't exactly work
