176
00:14:09,911 --> 00:14:15,250
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yea we're friends... I mean
it is obvious, isn't it?</font>

177
00:14:19,045 --> 00:14:25,218
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm new to this but I wonder if making
new friends is supposed to feel like this?</font>

178
00:14:26,219 --> 00:14:29,014
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I haven't had much time to process
it, but I know it makes me happy.</font>

179
00:14:29,097 --> 00:14:31,892
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- She's so sweet!
- She's so sweet!</font>

180
00:14:33,310 --> 00:14:34,436
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can't take it!</font>

181
00:14:35,353 --> 00:14:39,024
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You buncha old fogeys... you're
