182
00:14:39,107 --> 00:14:42,110
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Where's this comin' from?</font>

183
00:14:42,193 --> 00:14:45,196
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She has a special someone. And it's
one she's been watching over since the</font>

184
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:48,491
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">beginning.</font>

185
00:14:50,952 --> 00:14:53,538
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">To tell you the truth,
there's someone that I like.</font>

186
00:14:53,622 --> 00:14:56,166
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

187
00:14:56,249 --> 00:14:59,878
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's just that I'd like
you to help me out, Sawako.</font>

188
00:14:59,961 --> 00:15:02,631
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The person I like... it's Kazehaya.</font>

189
00:15:07,636 --> 00:15:11,431
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya is going to
have thar special someone?</font>

190
00:15:12,766 --> 00:15:15,477
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And I'm going to help with that?</font>

191
00:15:16,561 --> 00:15:18,813
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you so much, Sawako.</font>

192
00:15:18,897 --> 00:15:21,066
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Really, that makes me so happy!</font>

193
00:15:26,780 --> 00:15:27,989
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can't help you.</font>

194
00:15:28,531 --> 00:15:29,449
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

195
00:15:30,784 --> 00:15:32,869
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't think it's possible.</font>

196
00:15:35,288 --> 00:15:39,709
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's just I I can't support
you from the bottom of my heart.</font>

197
00:15:39,793 --> 00:15:41,962
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So that's why I can't help you.</font>

198
00:15:42,545 --> 00:15:45,757
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If I'm honest with myself, well,
I also think of him as special.</font>

199
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:49,386
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- So why do you think he's special?
- U-Umm...</font>

200
00:15:49,469 --> 00:15:53,640
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because he treated you nicely?
- Because he gave you attention? -Uh...</font>

201
00:15:53,723 --> 00:15:55,475
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because he showed you a
little bit of kindness?</font>

202
00:15:55,558 --> 00:15:57,686
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I- I guess?</font>

203
00:15:57,769 --> 00:16:01,189
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's just him doing charity work!
You're just looking for someone who treats</font>

204
00:16:01,272 --> 00:16:04,734
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you like a normal human being, it
doesn't have to be Kazehaya, right?!</font>

205
00:16:05,652 --> 00:16:07,195
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">H-hold on! Wait!</font>

206
00:16:10,365 --> 00:16:12,784
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ah, so that was what she wanted.</font>

207
00:16:12,867 --> 00:16:16,204
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But if Sawako can refuse her
request, it'll prove she's really grown</font>

208
00:16:16,287 --> 00:16:19,624
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- up!
- So she only started seeing Kazehaya in a</font>

209
00:16:19,708 --> 00:16:23,044
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">different light after speaking with her</font>

210
00:16:23,128 --> 00:16:24,004
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I see...
- I see...</font>

211
00:16:27,382 --> 00:16:28,299
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Like.</font>

212
00:16:32,387 --> 00:16:33,304
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Like!</font>

213
00:16:35,390 --> 00:16:38,685
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This is what "liking" someone is, right?</font>

214
00:16:42,147 --> 00:16:45,525
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Everything I feel towards the person in
front of me. All of it is that kind of</font>

215
00:16:45,608 --> 00:16:48,987
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">love, isn't it?</font>

216
00:16:54,868 --> 00:16:58,038
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The first person I tell should be her.</font>

217
00:17:01,583 --> 00:17:06,755
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Somewhere along the line we became
close enough to talk about love.</font>

218
00:17:10,425 --> 00:17:15,889
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The one who spread those rumors from
the bathroom incident was... Kurumi.</font>

219
00:17:15,972 --> 00:17:20,810
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako... the person responsible
for all that pain you went through</font>

220
00:17:22,604 --> 00:17:23,646
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was all her.</font>

221
00:17:25,398 --> 00:17:26,816
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I thought we were...</font>

222
00:17:27,358 --> 00:17:31,196
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Despite what I said I've
never considered us friends.</font>

223
00:17:35,408 --> 00:17:39,329
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Shouldn't you follow them
so you can all snitch on me?</font>

224
00:17:41,498 --> 00:17:45,710
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Once you do, you'll have all
