225
00:17:55,386 --> 00:17:57,263
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The game's over, huh?</font>

226
00:17:57,347 --> 00:18:00,558
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, in the end it was Sawako's win...</font>

227
00:18:00,642 --> 00:18:01,559
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey.</font>

228
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:05,522
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wonder... was that... really enough for her?</font>

229
00:18:06,815 --> 00:18:08,274
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hold on. What are-?</font>

230
00:18:08,900 --> 00:18:13,154
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well wasn't there
something... she still wanted to say?</font>

231
00:18:21,830 --> 00:18:24,415
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wanted to tell you I like Kazehaya.</font>

232
00:18:27,001 --> 00:18:29,546
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My feelings for him keep growing, so...</font>

233
00:18:29,629 --> 00:18:32,841
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I guess I should say I love him.</font>

234
00:18:35,510 --> 00:18:40,390
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Actually, that was what I came
to tell you in the first place.</font>

235
00:18:40,473 --> 00:18:44,310
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's something I been really
wanting to share with you.</font>

236
00:18:46,187 --> 00:18:50,400
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I told you you're in my way! I'll never
forgive you for daring to be around</font>

237
00:18:50,483 --> 00:18:54,696
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya without earning it!</font>

238
00:18:55,280 --> 00:18:59,075
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I had assumed with you,
I'd have no trouble winning.</font>

239
00:19:00,201 --> 00:19:06,624
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because nothing you do could ever
compare 'Cause I've always liked Kazehaya.</font>

240
00:19:08,251 --> 00:19:09,711
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And I'm sure of that.</font>

241
00:19:11,462 --> 00:19:15,300
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I hope this doesn't sound weird or
anything but compared to the first time I</font>

242
00:19:15,383 --> 00:19:19,220
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">met you, you seem much cuter
now than you were back then.</font>

243
00:19:19,304 --> 00:19:23,516
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I know I'm cute, that's not the point!</font>

244
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:26,394
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But but what good is being cute?</font>

245
00:19:28,771 --> 00:19:31,357
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It just hurts...</font>

246
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:35,945
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because I know he doesn't feel the same
way about me as I do about him. Since I've</font>

247
00:19:36,029 --> 00:19:40,116
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">always watched over him, I can tell.</font>

248
00:19:50,793 --> 00:19:52,962
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">There's already someone I like.</font>

249
00:19:54,672 --> 00:19:58,301
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's impossible for me to
see anyone else but her.</font>

250
00:20:00,553 --> 00:20:01,679
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm sorry.</font>

251
00:20:02,931 --> 00:20:08,311
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya, does me telling you that I
like you make you feel happy at all?</font>

252
00:20:11,773 --> 00:20:13,858
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah. Thank you.</font>

253
00:20:21,032 --> 00:20:25,870
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They both ended up falling in
love with the exact same person!</font>

254
00:20:25,954 --> 00:20:30,833
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So in other words, that makes those two...</font>

255
00:20:31,793 --> 00:20:35,713
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">... Even if you somehow manage to beat the
million to one odds against you getting</font>

256
00:20:35,797 --> 00:20:39,717
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">with Kazehaya, I will never, ever be able
to say I'm happy for you! 'Kay?! 'Cause if</font>

257
00:20:39,801 --> 00:20:42,470
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">he likes a girl, I
automatically hate her guts!</font>

258
00:20:42,553 --> 00:20:45,223
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Does that mean we can never be friends?</font>

259
00:20:48,393 --> 00:20:50,687
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What do you mean friends?</font>

260
00:20:50,770 --> 00:20:51,688
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh...</font>

261
00:20:53,648 --> 00:20:55,316
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I think you mean rivals.</font>

262
00:21:01,739 --> 00:21:04,117
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Woohoo!</font>

263
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:11,124
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm gonna have fun tonight! Oh! Isn't
that... Let's take this holy sake and...</font>

264
00:22:27,116 --> 00:22:28,993
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A moment of happiness.</font>

265
00:22:30,036 --> 00:22:32,080
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A place to make memories</font>

266
00:22:32,705 --> 00:22:34,582
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: "Day Off"</font>
